(benchmarks/tools/tts). Nothing below is linked into or shipped with the
application. Full list with versions: benchmarks/tools/tts/LICENSES.md.

Chatterbox Multilingual (ResembleAI/chatterbox)
    MIT. https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox
Piper voice en_US-libritts-high (reference voices only)
    CC-BY-4.0, from the LibriTTS corpus (Zen et al., 2019), https://www.openslr.org/60/
    Attribution required if audio produced with it is ever redistributed.
